<title>USA: Sysco unit names David Hunt as CEO.</title>
<headline>Sysco unit names David Hunt as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sysco Food Services - Horseheads, a unit of Sysco Corp, on Tuesday said it named Donald Hunt as president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Hunt had been executive vice president and chief operating officer of the division. The company did not say in its statement who Hunt was replacing.</p>
<p>Sysco Food Services - Horseheads provides food and other products and services to restaurants, health-care and educational facilities, among other establishments.</p>
</text>
